00:16:49.470 --> 00:16:51.110
Don't come inside!

00:16:51.310 --> 00:16:53.300
I'm cooling myself.

00:16:53.300 --> 00:16:54.920
I've already come inside.

00:16:54.920 --> 00:16:58.310
You're always like this, doing whatever you please.

00:16:58.310 --> 00:16:59.660
Aren't you the same?

00:16:59.660 --> 00:17:03.620
Why? Why did you have me come to school?

00:17:03.980 --> 00:17:05.080
Like I said that's--

00:17:05.080 --> 00:17:08.340
You... Kneeling down to your childhood friend Najimi?

00:17:08.340 --> 00:17:12.190
Why would you go that far? It's totally unreasonable!

00:17:12.190 --> 00:17:14.630
Ah, that... How should I say it?

00:17:15.010 --> 00:17:17.070
It's not that it had to be school.

00:17:17.800 --> 00:17:22.390
I wanted to see you make a fool of yourself in school.

00:17:22.390 --> 00:17:23.960
Born in Denmark...

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:27.560
You!

00:17:28.080 --> 00:17:30.890
Wait, wait! Then you can be born in Côte d'Ivoire!

00:17:30.890 --> 00:17:32.570
That's not the problem!

00:17:32.570 --> 00:17:34.780
Kakeru-chan, are you in here?

00:17:35.180 --> 00:17:37.650
Kakeru-chan! Melon-chan!

00:17:38.680 --> 00:17:39.850
What are you doing?

00:17:41.160 --> 00:17:43.870
What is it? What could it be?

00:17:43.870 --> 00:17:46.160
It's nothing. It's nothing.

00:17:49.190 --> 00:17:51.980
Huh? What? Why?

00:17:52.570 --> 00:17:54.920
Don't make fun of me!

00:17:55.900 --> 00:17:57.150
Kakeru-chan.

00:17:57.150 --> 00:17:59.490
What are you doing!

00:17:59.490 --> 00:18:01.010
I didn't do it on purpose.

00:18:01.360 --> 00:18:03.160
Hey, anyone?

00:18:03.160 --> 00:18:06.020
Is anyone there or not?

00:18:06.720 --> 00:18:08.520
My cellphone won't work.

00:18:10.900 --> 00:18:12.230
Hey, are you all right?

00:18:12.920 --> 00:18:15.220
It seems like it getting colder.

00:18:17.440 --> 00:18:19.130
It can't be helped.

00:18:20.080 --> 00:18:23.870
Ka-Kakeru-chan? If you do this, then you'll--

00:18:23.870 --> 00:18:27.620
For a hot boy like me, this is like normal air conditioning.

00:18:27.620 --> 00:18:29.540
Besides, Melon-chan also...

00:18:29.770 --> 00:18:32.040
I'm fine in the cold.

00:18:32.410 --> 00:18:36.920
Thank you. You're always helping Najimi.

00:18:37.420 --> 00:18:39.420
That time two years ago too...

00:18:39.740 --> 00:18:40.790
Two years ago?

00:18:40.790 --> 00:18:42.890
Hey, that's already in the past.

00:18:43.240 --> 00:18:48.530
Najimi won't forget it. You saved me from bad people.

00:18:48.530 --> 00:18:51.980
Is that true? Kakeru saved you?

00:18:53.010 --> 00:18:55.110
I hadn't come to this town yet.

00:18:55.530 --> 00:18:58.670
When we were in middle school,

00:18:58.670 --> 00:19:02.820
people who hated Papa's company kidnapped Najimi.

00:19:03.460 --> 00:19:07.160
At that time, Kakeru was trying to save Najimi.

00:19:07.590 --> 00:19:09.890
Then Kakeru-chan...

00:19:15.400 --> 00:19:16.500
He shot them?

00:19:16.660 --> 00:19:19.880
Kakeru is not bad. It was a justifiable defense.

00:19:19.880 --> 00:19:23.010
Also, the bad people only ended up being injured.

00:19:23.400 --> 00:19:27.850
But, because of that, everyone said bad things about Kakeru-chan,

00:19:28.070 --> 00:19:30.830
and he couldn't stay in that town.

00:19:30.830 --> 00:19:34.960
At that time Najimi was the only one willing to talk to me.

00:19:34.960 --> 00:19:37.150
I'm grateful to you.

00:19:37.300 --> 00:19:42.460
That's because you saved my life! Papa was also very grateful to you.

00:19:42.460 --> 00:19:44.530
So, regarding Melon-chan...

00:19:44.530 --> 00:19:48.090
Is it? As I thought it's all because of me.

00:19:48.090 --> 00:19:49.740
I'm grateful, Melon!

00:19:50.850 --> 00:19:52.380
Wait! You...

00:19:53.570 --> 00:19:56.740
It's lonely when you're alone.

00:19:58.940 --> 00:20:00.150
Kakeru...

00:20:00.630 --> 00:20:02.520
So that's how it is, Melon.

00:20:02.520 --> 00:20:06.580
Quickly make some friends and let Father feel relieved.

00:20:06.580 --> 00:20:08.650
You're her father?

00:20:08.650 --> 00:20:11.560
Yeah! Melon is from 16 years ago.

00:20:11.560 --> 00:20:16.960
That is to say she is a daughter born when I was zero years old. Can a child have children?

00:20:16.960 --> 00:20:20.420
Kakeru-chan, I'm returning this to you. You'll catch a cold.

00:20:20.420 --> 00:20:23.580
Idiot. Who would wear the uniform of such a boy?

00:20:23.580 --> 00:20:24.990
Don't say that, Kakeru-chan!

00:20:25.220 --> 00:20:27.510
Who would wear that?

00:20:26.990 --> 00:20:29.700
Don't say such a thing. Come on...

00:20:27.510 --> 00:20:29.700
You... Really...

00:20:29.700 --> 00:20:30.970
I don't want! it!

00:20:40.080 --> 00:20:40.940
Kakeru.

00:20:40.940 --> 00:20:42.170
Kakeru-chan?

00:20:42.440 --> 00:20:45.360
In the cold that's what we should do!

00:20:45.360 --> 00:20:48.590
Strip naked and warm up together.

00:20:49.430 --> 00:20:50.530
Are you all right, Najimi?

00:20:52.020 --> 00:20:53.890
Ko-Kochikaze!

00:20:54.200 --> 00:20:57.340
What are you doing, Daichi?

00:20:58.570 --> 00:21:00.360
Wait, listen to me first!

00:21:06.380 --> 00:21:09.060
Today was so miserable.

00:21:09.060 --> 00:21:12.000
I have these miserable memories because of whom?

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:13.420
It's because of me, right?

00:21:18.060 --> 00:21:20.460
You're an honest one.

00:21:21.230 --> 00:21:22.960
I-I'm not really...

00:21:23.480 --> 00:21:25.520
Make it well.

00:21:25.520 --> 00:21:26.880
Your own place.

00:21:28.010 --> 00:21:29.460
Idiot.

00:23:16.300 --> 00:23:20.670
We're in trouble! Kakeru-chan and Melon-chan are in trouble!

00:23:20.670 --> 00:23:23.160
It's not a pervert. We're in trouble!

00:23:23.160 --> 00:23:25.760
Eh? Najimi is also in trouble?

00:23:26.600 --> 00:23:29.050
It's Najimi's first?
